-- World fixes: holiday quests offered all year (2026-11-23)
-- Four (Pilgrim's Bounty): the Human Commoner announcer in Stormwind offers Costumed Orphan Matron, Brewfest!,
-- The Master of Summer Lore, Spring Collectors, A Season for Celebration and two Pilgrim's Bounty quests at once.
-- Found: 212 holiday quests sit in both creature_queststarter (always offered) and game_event_creature_quest
-- (offered during their holiday). TDB 8.3.7 never has both: its holiday quests are only in game_event_creature_quest,
-- and our event links already match 8.3.7's. Commoners, vendors and other NPCs that stand all year therefore offered
-- every holiday's quests. By holiday: Lunar Festival 87, Midsummer 45, Brewfest 24, Winter Veil 17, Love is in the Air 14, Noblegarden 12, Hallow's End 6, Pilgrim's Bounty 5, Children's Week 2.
-- Costumed Orphan Matron (11356, Hallow's End) was always offered by six commoners with no event link at all;
-- TDB 8.3.7 has no giver for it. Under the quest rule it is kept and moved to Hallow's End (event 12) instead.
-- Changed: the always-on rows of those quests removed (the event links stay), 11356 on Hallow's End. Safe to run twice.

-- 1. Holiday quests only during their holiday
